==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Kamen Rider Cat (Rare Cat)|Kamen Rider Cat]], [[Cat Godzilla (Rare Cat)|Cat Godzilla]], [[Evangelion Cat (Rare Cat)|Evangelion Cat]] and [[Ultraman Cat (Rare Cat)|Ultraman Cat]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns as the boss.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
The enemies in this stage can be tough, though they are made manageable when fought one-at-a-time. Each usable unit here is effective against a corresponding enemy without having to worry about single-target limitations.
* [[Kamen Rider Cat (Rare Cat)|Kamen Rider Cat]] works against [[St. Pigge the 2nd]].
* [[Evangelion Cat (Rare Cat)|Evangelion Cat]] works against [[Angelic Sleipnir]].
* [[Ultraman Cat (Rare Cat)|Ultraman Cat]] works against [[Dark Otter]].
* [[Cat Godzilla (Rare Cat)|Cat Godzilla]] works against [[Teacher Bun Bun]].
With high enough levels and the right [[Cat Cannon]], this stage becomes rather straightforward. However, [[Cat Combo]]s can still be used here where needed.

